
### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

###

### Create mystery
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "premise": "A valuable diamond disappeared from a locked museum room.",
  "difficulty": "Easy"
}

### Get existing mystery case
GET http://localhost:5000/api/cases/6ae41febafa4db93fb344edd

### Discover first clue
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cases/6ae41febafa4db93fb344edd/clues/6ae41febafa4db93fb344ee1/discover

### Request first hint
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cases/6ae41febafa4db93fb344edd/hints

### Generate a fresh mystery with hints
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "premise": "A valuable diamond disappeared from a locked museum room.",
  "difficulty": "Easy"
}

### Request first hint
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cases/6ae434889ea453d64593487c/hints

### Accuse a suspect
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cases/6ae434889ea453d64593487c/accuse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "suspectName": "Simon Reed"
}

### Get mystery result
GET http://localhost:5000/api/cases/6ae434889ea453d64593487c/result

POST http://localhost:5000/api/cases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "premise": "A businessman was found murdered in his locked office. Three employees had access to the office, and each has a different story.",
  "difficulty": "Easy"
}

